<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GTA VI | Responsive Fan Page</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #f4f4f4;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .character-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; 
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        article {
            background: #2d2d2d;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 5px solid #ff006e; 
        }


        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .character-grid {

                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            img {
                width: 100% !important; /* Make image full width on mobile */
            }
        }

        .preview-img {
            display: block;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border: 2px solid #444;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        nav a { color: #00adef; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Grand Theft Auto VI</h1>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
                <li><a href="#characters">Characters</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="about">
            <h2>About the Game</h2>
            <p><b>GTA 6</b> takes players back to <i>Vice City</i>.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="characters">
            <h2>Main Characters</h2>
            <div class="character-grid">
                <article>
                    <h4>Lucia</h4>
                    <p>One of the first female protagonists in the series, Lucia brings a gritty, street-smart perspective to the story.</p>
                </article>
                <article>
                    <h4>Jason</h4>
                    <p>Jason is the tactical partner to Lucia, completing the high-stakes duo inspired by legendary outlaws.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="logo">
            <h2>Game Preview</h2>
            <img class="preview-img" 
                 src="https://www.rockstargames.com/VI/_next/image?url=%2FVI%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FJason_and_Lucia_01_With_Logos_landscape.8596f77a.jpg&w=3840&q=75" 
                 alt="GTA 6 Preview" 
                 width="50%">
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <hr>
        <p>© 2026 GTA 6 Fan Page</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>